0..75 Comment "// A model of an extension where a model of the theory it includes is asked"
76..154 Comment "// (#1092): each theory a block includes, directly or through another, takes a"
155..234 Comment "// reduct, `Monoid.Semigroup` from `Model(Monoid)` to `Model(Semigroup)`, which"
235..314 Comment "// keeps the members the inclusion places and forgets the rest; a sort is kept,"
315..388 Comment "// never sealed. The checker applies it where the one model stands at the"
389..462 Comment "// other, and the run and the kernel read the application. A model of the"
463..540 Comment "// extension with its carrier manifest stands there too, by the map that puts"
541..588 Comment "// the carrier back and then restricts (#2136)."
590..665 Comment "// The semigroup, the monoid, both extensions at once, and the endomorphism"
666..676 Comment "// monoid."
